1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Galleta's Diary · Chapter 1

2
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,200
December 31st.

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
Outside, everyone was celebrating.

4
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,900
Under a car,

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,600
someone was trembling.

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
I don't go out at night.

7
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,700
I never go out.

8
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,150
But that dog…

9
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,100
was all alone.

10
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,150
I told him:

11
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,600
"Follow me, four-legged human."

12
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,600
And he followed me.

13
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,800
It was the worst night of his life.

14
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:33,000
